sentences.text:
The impugned judgment and award passed in MVC 529/2012 by the Additional Senior Civil Judge and MACT, Srirangapatna, dated 25.03.2014 is modified;
(a) The claimant is entitled to enhancement of compensation of Rs.68,000/- with interest at the rate of 6% p.a., on the enhanced amount of compensation from the date of petition till its realization.
iv.

